{"step_index":54,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-10T10:27:46Z","input_tokens":5259,"cache_read_tokens":163605,"output_tokens":9612,"thinking":"Planning to integrate the execution controls and the input playground into the application's core logic. The goal is to provide a complete interactive experience, enabling users to manage and experiment with the program's execution flow. This will involve establishing connections between these UI elements and the underlying execution engine.\n\n\nThe problem requires finding the contiguous subarray within a given array that has the largest sum. Initially, considered brute-force approaches but quickly realized the need for a more efficient algorithm. Dynamic programming seems suitable, considering subproblem optimality. Now, testing the implementation against the example inputs to validate the logic.\n\nInvestigating the execution visualization to understand the specific steps. It seems the code tracks the current maximum sum and the overall maximum sum encountered so far. Trying to understand the logic for updating these values in each iteration. Looking for edge cases such as all-negative arrays.\n\nSuspecting the logic is correct, particularly the handling of negative numbers by potentially discarding negative prefixes. Verification via visualization continues. The built-in questions are helping ensure comprehensive understanding.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"// app.js — Separated UI & Execution History Controller\n// Synchronizes Panel A (Code Editor), Panel B (Execution Visualizer),\n// Panel C (Variable Inspector & Built-In Questions), and Panel D (7-Part Beginner Explanation).\n\nclass CodeFlowVisualizerApp {\n  constructor() {\n    this.engine = new window.PythonExecutionEngine();\n    this.explainer = new window.RuleBasedExplainer();\n\n    this.currentPresetKey = \"max_subarray\";\n    this.originalCode = window.PRELOADED_PROGRAMS[this.currentPresetKey].code;\n    this.sourceCode = this.originalCode;\n    this.inputCode = window.PRELOADED_PROGRAMS[this.currentPresetKey].defaultInput;\n    this.algorithmOverview = window.PRELOADED_PROGRAMS[this.currentPresetKey].algorithmOverview;\n\n    this.traceResult = null;\n    this.currentStepIdx = 0;\n    this.isPlaying = false;\n    this.isPaused = false;\n    this.playInterval = null;\n    this.playSpeedMs = 950;\n    this.explanationMode = \"beginner\"; // 'beginner' | 'technical'\n    this.practiceMode = false;\n    this.isEditing = false;\n    this.activeQuestionId = \"what_line_does\";\n    this.selectedHistoryVar = null;\n\n    this.initDOM();\n    this.bindEvents();\n    this.loadPreset(this.currentPresetKey);\n  }\n\n  initDOM() {\n    // Execution Controls (Section 5)\n    this.btnStart = document.getElementById(\"btnStart\");\n    this.btnPause = document.getElementById(\"btnPause\");\n    this.btnResume = document.getElementById(\"btnResume\");\n    this.btnPrev = document.getElementById(\"btnPrev\");\n    this.btnNext = document.getElementById(\"btnNext\");\n    this.btnRestart = document.getElementById(\"btnRestart\");\n    this.stepBadge = document.getElementById(\"stepBadge\");\n    this.timelineSlider = document.getElementById(\"timelineSlider\");\n    this.speedSelect = document.getElementById(\"speedSelect\");\n    this.btnPracticeMode = document.getElementById(\"btnPracticeMode\");\n\n    // Input Playground (Section 11)\n    this.inputPlaygroundField = document.getElementById(\"inputPlaygroundField\");\n    this.btnRunInput = document.getElementById(\"btnRunInput\");\n    this.inputPresetBtns = document.querySelectorAll(\".btn-chip\");\n\n    // Panel A: Code Editor\n    this.presetSelect = document.getElementById(\"presetSelect\");\n    this.btnLoadExample = document.getElementById(\"btnLoadExample\");\n    this.btnEditCode = document.getElementById(\"btnEditCode\");\n    this.btnReset = document.getElementById(\"btnReset\");\n    this.btnAnalyzeCode = document.getElementById(\"btnAnalyzeCode\");\n    this.validationBanner = document.getElementById(\"validationBanner\");\n    this.codeLinesContainer = document.getElementById(\"codeLinesContainer\");\n    this.liveEditorWrap = document.getElementById(\"liveEditorWrap\");\n    this.editorLineNumbers = document.getElementById(\"editorLineNumbers\");\n    this.codeTextarea = document.getElementById(\"codeTextarea\");\n\n    // Panel B: Execution Visualizer\n    this.flowEventBadge = document.getElementById(\"flowEventBadge\");\n    this.algorithmPurposeBox = document.getElementById(\"algorithmPurposeBox\");\n    this.practiceCard = document.getElementById(\"practiceCard\");\n    this.practicePrompt = document.getElementById(\"practicePrompt\");\n    this.practiceOptions = document.getElementById(\"practiceOptions\");\n    this.practiceFeedback = document.getElementById(\"practiceFeedback\");\n    this.metricStep = document.getElementById(\"metricStep\");\n    this.metricCurrentLine = document.getElementById(\"metricCurrentLine\");\n    this.metricLoopIter = document.getElementById(\"metricLoopIter\");\n    this.metricNextLine = document.getElementById(\"metricNextLine\");\n    this.flowScopeLabel = document.getElementById(\"flowScopeLabel\");\n    this.flowCodeStatement = document.getElementById(\"flowCodeStatement\");\n    this.flowStepSummary = document.getElementById(\"flowStepSummary\");\n    this.flowBeforeAfter = document.getElementById(\"flowBeforeAfter\");\n    this.flowConditionResult = document.getElementById(\"flowConditionResult\");\n    this.executionSummaryTag = document.getElementById(\"executionSummaryTag\");\n    this.flowchartSvgWrap = document.getElementById(\"flowchartSvgWrap\");\n\n    // Panel C: Variable Inspector & Built-In Questions\n    this.activeScopeBadge = document.getElementById(\"activeScopeBadge\");\n    this.varInspectorTbody = document.getElementById(\"varInspectorTbody\");\n    this.visualListsContainer = document.getElementById(\"visualListsContainer\");\n    this.varHistoryBox = document.getElementById(\"varHistoryBox\");\n    this.questionChips = document.querySelectorAll(\".q-chip\");\n    this.questionAnswerBox = document.getElementById(\"questionAnswerBox\");\n\n    // Panel D: 7-Part Beginner Explanation\n    this.modeBtns = document.querySelectorAll(\".mode-btn\");\n    this.exp1WhatLineDoes = document.getElementById(\"exp1WhatLineDoes\");\n    this.exp2Symbols = document.getElementById(\"exp2Symbols\");\n    this.exp3WhyNow = document.getElementById(\"exp3WhyNow\");\n    this.exp4VarsBefore = document.getElementById(\"exp4VarsBefore\");\n    this.exp5ChangesAfter = document.getElementById(\"exp5ChangesAfter\");\n    this.exp6WhyCondition = document.getElementById(\"exp6WhyCondition\");\n    this.exp7NextLine = document.getElementById(\"exp7NextLine\");\n\n    // Populate Program Selector\n    Object.entries(window.PRELOADED_PROGRAMS).forEach(([key, item]) => {\n      const opt = document.createElement(\"option\");\n      opt.value = key;\n      opt.textContent = item.title;\n      this.presetSelect.appendChild(opt);\n    });\n  }\n\n  bindEvents() {\n    // Execution Controls (Section 5)\n    this.btnStart.addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n      this.currentStepIdx = 0;\n      this.renderStep();\n      this.startPlayback();\n    });\n\n    this.btnPause.addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n      this.pausePlayback(true);\n    });\n\n    this.btnResume.addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n      this.startPlayback();\n    });\n\n    this.btnPrev.addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n      this.pausePlayback(false);\n      this.goToStep(this.currentStepIdx - 1);\n    });\n\n    this.btnNext.addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n      this.pausePlayback(false);\n      this.goToStep(this.currentStepIdx + 1);\n    });\n\n    this.btnRestart.addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n      this.pausePlayback(false);\n      this.goToStep(0);\n    });\n\n    this.timelineSlider.addEventListener(\"input\", (e) => {\n      this.pausePlayback(false);\n      this.goToStep(Number(e.target.value));\n    });\n\n    this.speedSelect.addEventListener(\"change\", (e) => {\n      this.playSpeedMs = Number(e.target.value);\n      if (this.isPlaying) {\n        this.pausePlayback(true);\n        this.startPlayback();\n      }\n    });\n\n    this.btnPracticeMode.addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n      this.practiceMode = !this.practiceMode;\n      this.btnPracticeMode.textContent = this.practiceMode\n        ? \"Practice Mode: ON\"\n        : \"Practice Mode: OFF\";\n      this.btnPracticeMode.classList.toggle(\"btn-accent\", this.practiceMode);\n      this.renderStep();\n    });\n\n    // Input Playground (Section 11)\n    this.btnRunInput.addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n      this.inputCode = this.inputPlaygroundField.value;\n      this.analyzeAndRun();\n    });\n\n    this.inputPlaygroundField.addEventListener(\"keydown\", (e) => {\n      if (e.key === \"Enter\") {\n        this.inputCode = this.inputPlaygroundField.value;\n        this.analyzeAndRun();\n      }\n    });\n\n    this.inputPresetBtns.forEach((btn) => {\n      btn.addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n        this.inputPlaygroundField.value = btn.dataset.input;\n        this.inputCode = btn.dataset.input;\n        this.analyzeAndRun();\n      });\n    });\n\n    // Panel A: Code Editor Controls\n    this.presetSelect.addEventListener(\"change\", (e) => {\n      this.loadPreset(e.target.value);\n    });\n\n    this.btnLoadExample.addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n      this.loadPreset(this.presetSelect.value);\n    });\n\n    this.btnEditCode.addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n      this.setEditMode(!this.isEditing);\n    });\n\n    this.btnReset.addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n      this.pausePlayback(false);\n      const prog = window.PRELOADED_PROGRAMS[this.currentPresetKey];\n      this.sourceCode = prog.code;\n      this.inputCode = prog.defaultInput;\n      this.inputPlaygroundField.value = this.inputCode;\n      this.codeTextarea.value = this.sourceCode;\n      this.setEditMode(false);\n      this.analyzeAndRun();\n    });\n\n    this.btnAnalyzeCode.addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n      if (this.isEditing) {\n        this.sourceCode = this.codeTextarea.value;\n        this.setEditMode(false);\n      }\n      this.inputCode = this.inputPlaygroundField.value;\n      this.analyzeAndRun();\n    });\n\n    this.codeTextarea.addEventListener(\"input\", () => {\n      this.updateEditorLineNumbers();\n    });\n\n    this.codeTextarea.addEventListener(\"scroll\", () => {\n      this.editorLineNumbers.scrollTop = this.codeTextarea.scrollTop;\n    });\n\n    // Built-In Code Questions (Section 9)\n    this.questionChips.forEach((chip) => {\n      chip.addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n        this.questionChips.forEach((c) => c.classList.remove(\"active\"));\n        chip.classList.add(\"active\");\n        this.activeQuestionId = chip.dataset.qid;\n        this.renderBuiltInQuestionAnswer();\n      });\n    });\n\n    // Panel D: Explanation Mode Switcher\n    this.modeBtns.forEach((btn) => {\n      btn.addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n        this.modeBtns.forEach((b) => b.classList.remove(\"active\"));\n        btn.classList.add(\"active\");\n        this.explanationMode = btn.dataset.mode;\n        this.renderStep();\n      });\n    });\n\n    // Keyboard shortcuts\n    window.addEventListener(\"keydown\", (e) => {\n      if (\n        document.activeElement === this.codeTextarea ||\n        document.activeElement === this.inputPlaygroundField\n      ) {\n        return;\n      }\n      if (e.key === \"ArrowRight\") {\n        e.preventDefault();\n        this.pausePlayback(false);\n        this.goToStep(this.currentStepIdx + 1);\n      } else if (e.key === \"ArrowLeft\") {\n        e.preventDefault();\n        this.pausePlayback(false);\n        this.goToStep(this.currentStepIdx - 1);\n      }\n    });\n  }\n\n  loadPreset(key) {\n    this.pausePlayback(false);\n    this.currentPresetKey = key;\n    const item = window.PRELOADED_PROGRAMS[key];\n    this.originalCode = item.code;\n    this.sourceCode = item.code;\n    this.inputCode = item.defaultInput;\n    this.algorithmOverview = item.algorithmOverview;\n\n    this.inputPlaygroundField.value = this.inputCode;\n    this.codeTextarea.value = this.sourceCode;\n    this.selectedHistoryVar = null;\n    this.varHistoryBox.classList.add(\"hidden\");\n    this.setEditMode(false);\n    this.analyzeAndRun();\n  }\n\n  setEditMode(editing) {\n    this.isEditing = editing;\n    if (editing) {\n      this.pausePlayback(false);\n      this.codeTextarea.value = this.sourceCode;\n      this.updateEditorLineNumbers();\n      this.liveEditorWrap.classList.remove(\"hidden\");\n      this.codeLinesContainer.classList.add(\"hidden\");\n      this.btnEditCode.textContent = \"Cancel Edit\";\n    } else {\n      this.liveEditorWrap.classList.add(\"hidden\");\n      this.codeLinesContainer.classList.remove(\"hidden\");\n      this.btnEditCode.textContent = \"Edit Code\";\n    }\n  }\n\n  updateEditorLineNumbers() {\n    const count = this.codeTextarea.value.split(\"\\n\").length;\n    const arr = [];\n    for (let i = 1; i <= count; i++) arr.push(i);\n    this.editorLineNumbers.innerHTML = arr.join(\"<br>\");\n  }\n\n  analyzeAndRun() {\n    this.pausePlayback(false);\n    const rawTrace = this.engine.trace(this.sourceCode, this.inputCode);\n    this.traceResult = this.explainer.enrichTraceWithExplanations(rawTrace);\n\n    if (!this.traceResult.ok) {\n      this.validationBanner.textContent = `⚠ ${this.traceResult.errorMessage}`;\n      this.validationBanner.classList.remove(\"hidden\");\n    } else {\n      this.validationBanner.classList.add(\"hidden\");\n    }\n\n    const total = this.traceResult.steps.length;\n    this.timelineSlider.max = Math.max(0, total - 1);\n    this.currentStepIdx = 0;\n\n    this.algorithmPurposeBox.innerHTML = `<strong>Algorithm Purpose:</strong> ${this.formatMarkdown(this.algorithmOverview)}`;\n    this.executionSummaryTag.innerHTML = this.formatMarkdown(this.traceResult.executionSummary || \"\");\n\n    this.renderStep();\n  }\n\n  goToStep(idx) {\n    if (!this.traceResult || !this.traceResult.steps.length) return;\n    this.currentStepIdx = Math.max(0, Math.min(idx, this.traceResult.steps.length - 1));\n    this.renderStep();\n  }\n\n  startPlayback() {\n    if (!this.traceResult || !this.traceResult.steps.length) return;\n    if (this.currentStepIdx >= this.traceResult.steps.length - 1) {\n      this.currentStepIdx = 0;\n    }\n    this.isPlaying = true;\n    this.isPaused = false;\n    this.updateTransportButtons();\n\n    this.playInterval = setInterval(() => {\n      if (this.currentStepIdx < this.traceResult.steps.length - 1) {\n        this.currentStepIdx++;\n        this.renderStep();\n      } else {\n        this.pausePlayback(false);\n      }\n    }, this.playSpeedMs);\n  }\n\n  pausePlayback(canResume = false) {\n    this.isPlaying = false;\n    this.isPaused = canResume;\n    if (this.playInterval) {\n      clearInterval(this.playInterval);\n      this.playInterval = null;\n    }\n    this.updateTransportButtons();\n  }\n\n  updateTransportButtons() {\n    const total = this.traceResult && this.traceResult.steps ? this.traceResult.steps.length : 0;\n    this.btnStart.disabled = this.isPlaying || total === 0;\n    this.btnPause.disabled = !this.isPlaying;\n    this.btnResume.disabled = this.isPlaying || !this.isPaused || this.currentStepIdx >= total - 1;\n    this.btnPrev.disabled = this.currentStepIdx <= 0 || total === 0;\n    this.btnNext.disabled = this.currentStepIdx >= total - 1 || total === 0;\n    this.btnRestart.disabled = total === 0;\n  }\n\n  renderStep() {\n    if (!this.traceResult || !this.traceResult.steps.length) {\n      this.codeLinesContainer.innerHTML = \"\";\n      this.traceResult.rawLines.forEach((rawLine, idx) => {\n        const lineNum = idx + 1;\n        const isErrLine = this.traceResult.errorLine === lineNum;\n        const row = document.createElement(\"div\");\n        row.className = \"code-row\";\n        if (isErrLine) row.style.background = \"rgba(248, 81, 73, 0.2)\";\n        row.innerHTML = `\n          <div class=\"code-gutter\"><span class=\"gutter-ln\">${lineNum}</span></div>\n          <div class=\"code-syntax\">${this.highlightPythonSyntax(rawLine)}</div>\n        `;\n        this.codeLinesContainer.appendChild(row);\n      });\n      this.updateTransportButtons();\n      return;\n    }\n\n    const steps = this.traceResult.steps;\n    const step = steps[this.currentStepIdx];\n    const total = steps.length;\n\n    this.timelineSlider.value = this.currentStepIdx;\n    this.stepBadge.textContent = `Step ${this.currentStepIdx + 1} / ${total}`;\n    this.updateTransportButtons();\n\n    this.renderPanelACodeEditor(step);\n    this.renderPanelBVisualizer(step, total);\n    this.renderPanelCVariableInspector(step);\n    this.renderPanelDExplanation(step);\n    this.renderBuiltInQuestionAnswer();\n  }\n\n  /* ==========================================\n     PANEL A: Code Editor & Line States\n     ========================================== */\n  renderPanelACodeEditor(step) {\n    const executedLinesMap = {};\n    for (let i = 0; i < this.currentStepIdx; i++) {\n      const s = this.traceResult.steps[i];\n      if (!executedLinesMap[s.line]) executedLinesMap[s.line] = [];\n      executedLinesMap[s.line].push(s.stepIndex);\n    }\n\n    this.codeLinesContainer.innerHTML = \"\";\n    this.traceResult.rawLines.forEach((rawLine, idx) => {\n      const lineNum = idx + 1;\n      const isCurrent = step.line === lineNum;\n      const isNext = step.nextLine === lineNum && !isCurrent;\n      const wasExecuted = Boolean(executedLinesMap[lineNum]);\n\n      const row = document.createElement(\"div\");\n      row.className = \"code-row\";\n      if (isCurrent) row.classList.add(\"state-current\");\n      else if (isNext) row.classList.add(\"state-next\");\n      else if (wasExecuted) row.classList.add(\"state-executed\");\n      else row.classList.add(\"state-upcoming\");\n\n      const marker = isCurrent ? \"▶\" : isNext ? \"↳\" : wasExecuted ? \"✓\" : \"\";\n      const markerColor = isCurrent ? \"#58a6ff\" : isNext ? \"#d29922\" : \"#3fb950\";\n\n      let badgesHTML = \"\";\n      if (isCurrent) {\n        badgesHTML += `<span class=\"inline-state-tag\">${this.escapeHTML(step.changedSummary)}</span>`;\n      } else if (wasExecuted) {\n        const recent = executedLinesMap[lineNum].slice(-2).map((n) => `#${n}`).join(\",\");\n        badgesHTML += `<span class=\"step-order-tag\">${recent}</span>`;\n      }\n\n      row.innerHTML = `\n        <div class=\"code-gutter\">\n          <span class=\"gutter-marker\" style=\"color:${markerColor}\">${marker}</span>\n          <span class=\"gutter-ln\">${lineNum}</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"code-syntax\">${this.highlightPythonSyntax(rawLine)}</div>\n        <div class=\"code-row-badges\">${badgesHTML}</div>\n      `;\n\n      row.addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n        const targetIdx = this.traceResult.steps.findIndex((s) => s.line === lineNum);\n        if (targetIdx !== -1) {\n          this.pausePlayback(false);\n          this.goToStep(targetIdx);\n        }\n      });\n\n      this.codeLinesContainer.appendChild(row);\n    });\n  }\n\n  highlightPythonSyntax(line) {\n    if (!line) return \" \";\n    let commentPart = \"\";\n    let codePart = line;\n    const hashIdx = line.indexOf(\"#\");\n    if (hashIdx !== -1) {\n      codePart = line.slice(0, hashIdx);\n      commentPart = `<span class=\"syn-com\">${this.escapeHTML(line.slice(hashIdx))}</span>`;\n    }\n\n    const tokenRegex = /(\".*?\"|'.*?'|\\b(?:class|def|return|if|elif|else|for|while|in|break|continue|and|or|not|True|False|None|self)\\b|\\b(?:print|range|len|min|max|abs|sum|list|int)\\b|\\b\\d+(?:\\.\\d+)?\\b)/g;\n    const highlighted = this.escapeHTML(codePart).replace(tokenRegex, (match) => {\n      if (match.startsWith('\"') || match.startsWith(\"'\")) {\n        return `<span class=\"syn-str\">${match}</span>`;\n      }\n      if (/^(class|def|return|if|elif|else|for|while|in|break|continue|and|or|not|True|False|None|self)$/.test(match)) {\n        return `<span class=\"syn-kw\">${match}</span>`;\n      }\n      if (/^(print|range|len|min|max|abs|sum|list|int)$/.test(match)) {\n        return `<span class=\"syn-bi\">${match}</span>`;\n      }\n      if (/^\\d/.test(match)) {\n        return `<span class=\"syn-num\">${match}</span>`;\n      }\n      return match;\n    });\n\n    return highlighted + commentPart;\n  }\n\n  /* ==========================================\n     PANEL B: Execution Visualizer (Center)\n     ========================================== */\n  renderPanelBVisualizer(step, total) {\n    this.flowEventBadge.textContent = step.eventType;\n    this.metricStep.textContent = `Step ${step.stepIndex} of ${total}`;\n    this.metricCurrentLine.textContent = `Line ${step.line}`;\n    this.metricNextLine.textContent = step.nextLine ? `Line ${step.nextLine}` : \"Program End\";\n\n    if (step.loop) {\n      const lp = step.loop;\n      const iterStr = lp.totalIterations\n        ? `Pass ${lp.currentIteration}/${lp.totalIterations} (${lp.iterVar}=${lp.currentItemValue ?? \"done\"})`\n        : `Iteration #${lp.currentIteration}`;\n      this.metricLoopIter.textContent = iterStr;\n    } else {\n      this.metricLoopIter.textContent = \"None\";\n    }\n\n    this.flowScopeLabel.textContent = step.functionName;\n    this.flowCodeStatement.innerHTML = this.highlightPythonSyntax(step.codeText);\n\n    const exp = step.explanations;\n    const mainSummary =\n      this.explanationMode === \"technical\" ? exp.whatTechnical : exp.whatBeginner;\n    this.flowStepSummary.innerHTML = this.formatMarkdown(mainSummary);\n\n    this.flowBeforeAfter.textContent = step.changedSummary;\n\n    if (step.condition) {\n      const c = step.condition;\n      this.flowConditionResult.innerHTML = `<span style=\"color:${c.result ? \"#3fb950\" : \"#f85149\"}; font-weight:700;\">${this.escapeHTML(c.leftVal)} ${this.escapeHTML(c.operator)} ${this.escapeHTML(c.rightVal)} → ${c.result ? \"True\" : \"False\"}</span>`;\n    } else if (step.returnValue !== null) {\n      this.flowConditionResult.innerHTML = `<span style=\"color:#3fb950; font-weight:700;\">Returned: ${this.escapeHTML(step.returnValue)}</span>`;\n    } else {\n      this.flowConditionResult.textContent = \"N/A (Not a condition step)\";\n    }\n\n    // Practice Mode Prediction Card\n    if (this.practiceMode && step.practiceQuestion) {\n      const pq = step.practiceQuestion;\n      this.practiceCard.classList.remove(\"hidden\");\n      this.practiceFeedback.classList.add(\"hidden\");\n      this.practicePrompt.innerHTML = this.formatMarkdown(pq.prompt);\n      this.practiceOptions.innerHTML = \"\";\n      pq.options.forEach((opt) => {\n        const btn = document.createElement(\"button\");\n        btn.className = \"practice-opt-btn\";\n        btn.textContent = opt.label;\n        btn.addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n          btn.classList.add(opt.correct ? \"correct\" : \"wrong\");\n          this.practiceFeedback.innerHTML = `${opt.correct ? \"✓ Correct! \" : \"✗ Not quite. \"}${this.formatMarkdown(pq.explanation)}`;\n          this.practiceFeedback.classList.remove(\"hidden\");\n        });\n        this.practiceOptions.appendChild(btn);\n      });\n    } else {\n      this.practiceCard.classList.add(\"hidden\");\n    }\n\n    this.renderFlowchartSVG(step);\n  }\n\n  renderFlowchartSVG(step) {\n    const cfg = this.traceResult.cfg;\n    if (!cfg || !cfg.nodes.length) return;\n\n    const nodeW = 195;\n    const nodeH = 32;\n    const vGap = 46;\n    const svgW = 360;\n    const svgH = Math.max(190, cfg.nodes.length * vGap + 26);\n\n    const positions = {};\n    cfg.nodes.forEach((n, idx) => {\n      positions[n.id] = { x: svgW / 2, y: 22 + idx * vGap };\n    });\n\n    const activeId = `L${step.line}`;\n    const nextId = step.nextLine ? `L${step.nextLine}` : \"end\";\n\n    let edgesSVG = \"\";\n    cfg.edges.forEach((edge) => {\n      const p1 = positions[edge.from];\n      const p2 = positions[edge.to];\n      if (!p1 || !p2) return;\n\n      const isActiveEdge = edge.from === activeId && edge.to === nextId;\n      const stroke = isActiveEdge ? \"#d29922\" : edge.isBackEdge ? \"#58a6ff\" : \"#30363d\";\n      const width = isActiveEdge ? 2.2 : 1.3;\n\n      if (edge.isBackEdge || p2.y <= p1.y) {\n        const leftX = 30;\n        edgesSVG += `<path d=\"M ${p1.x - nodeW / 2} ${p1.y} C ${leftX} ${p1.y}, ${leftX} ${p2.y}, ${p2.x - nodeW / 2} ${p2.y}\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"${stroke}\" stroke-width=\"${width}\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 2\" />`;\n      } else {\n        edgesSVG += `<line x1=\"${p1.x}\" y1=\"${p1.y + nodeH / 2}\" x2=\"${p2.x}\" y2=\"${p2.y - nodeH / 2}\" stroke=\"${stroke}\" stroke-width=\"${width}\" />`;\n      }\n    });\n\n    let nodesSVG = \"\";\n    cfg.nodes.forEach((node) => {\n      const pos = positions[node.id];\n      const isCurrent = node.line === step.line;\n      const isNext = node.line === step.nextLine && !isCurrent;\n\n      let fill = \"#161b22\";\n      let stroke = \"#30363d\";\n      if (isCurrent) {\n        fill = \"rgba(88, 166, 255, 0.22)\";\n        stroke = \"#58a6ff\";\n      } else if (isNext) {\n        fill = \"rgba(210, 153, 34, 0.14)\";\n        stroke = \"#d29922\";\n      }\n\n      if (node.type === \"decision\") {\n        const pts = `${pos.x},${pos.y - nodeH / 2 - 2} ${pos.x + nodeW / 2 + 8},${pos.y} ${pos.x},${pos.y + nodeH / 2 + 2} ${pos.x - nodeW / 2 - 8},${pos.y}`;\n        nodesSVG += `\n          <g style=\"cursor:pointer\" data-line=\"${node.line}\">\n            <polygon points=\"${pts}\" fill=\"${fill}\" stroke=\"${stroke}\" stroke-width=\"${isCurrent ? 2 : 1.3}\" />\n            <text x=\"${pos.x}\" y=\"${pos.y + 4}\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#e6edf3\" font-family=\"JetBrains Mono, monospace\" font-size=\"10.5\" font-weight=\"${isCurrent ? \"700\" : \"500\"}\">\n              ${this.escapeHTML(node.label)}\n            </text>\n          </g>\n        `;\n      } else {\n        const rx = node.type === \"start\" || node.type === \"end\" || node.type === \"loop\" ? 15 : 5;\n        nodesSVG += `\n          <g transform=\"translate(${pos.x - nodeW / 2}, ${pos.y - nodeH / 2})\" style=\"cursor:pointer\" data-line=\"${node.line}\">\n            <rect width=\"${nodeW}\" height=\"${nodeH}\" rx=\"${rx}\" fill=\"${fill}\" stroke=\"${stroke}\" stroke-width=\"${isCurrent ? 2 : 1.3}\" />\n            <text x=\"${nodeW / 2}\" y=\"${nodeH / 2 + 4}\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#e6edf3\" font-family=\"JetBrains Mono, monospace\" font-size=\"10.5\" font-weight=\"${isCurrent ? \"700\" : \"500\"}\">\n              ${this.escapeHTML(node.label)}\n            </text>\n          </g>\n        `;\n      }\n    });\n\n    this.flowchartSvgWrap.innerHTML = `\n      <svg width=\"${svgW}\" height=\"${svgH}\" viewBox=\"0 0 ${svgW} ${svgH}\">\n        ${edgesSVG}\n        ${nodesSVG}\n      </svg>\n    `;\n\n    this.flowchartSvgWrap.querySelectorAll(\"g[data-line]\").forEach((g) => {\n      g.addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n        const ln = Number(g.dataset.line);\n        const idx = this.traceResult.steps.findIndex((s) => s.line === ln);\n        if (idx !== -1) {\n          this.pausePlayback(false);\n          this.goToStep(idx);\n        }\n      });\n    });\n  }\n\n  /* ==========================================\n     PANEL C: Variable Inspector & Questions\n     ========================================== */\n  renderPanelCVariableInspector(step) {\n    this.activeScopeBadge.textContent = step.functionName;\n    this.varInspectorTbody.innerHTML = \"\";\n    this.visualListsContainer.innerHTML = \"\";\n\n    const vars = step.variables || [];\n    if (vars.length === 0) {\n      this.varInspectorTbody.innerHTML = `\n        <tr>\n          <td colspan=\"5\" style=\"text-align:center; color:var(--text-muted); padding:12px;\">\n            No local variables initialized in this scope yet.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n      `;\n    } else {\n      const iVar = vars.find((v) => v.name === \"i\" && typeof v.rawValue === \"number\");\n      const currentIdx = iVar ? iVar.rawValue : null;\n\n      vars.forEach((v) => {\n        const tr = document.createElement(\"tr\");\n        tr.style.cursor = \"pointer\";\n        if (v.status === \"created\") tr.classList.add(\"row-created\");\n        else if (v.status === \"updated\") tr.classList.add(\"row-updated\");\n\n        const statusClass =\n          v.status === \"created\"\n            ? \"status-created\"\n            : v.status === \"updated\"\n            ? \"status-updated\"\n            : \"status-unchanged\";\n\n        tr.innerHTML = `\n          <td><strong>${this.escapeHTML(v.name)}</strong></td>\n          <td class=\"val-prev\">${this.escapeHTML(v.previous)}</td>\n          <td class=\"val-curr\">${this.escapeHTML(v.current)}</td>\n          <td style=\"color:var(--text-secondary)\">${v.type}</td>\n          <td><span class=\"status-pill ${statusClass}\">${v.status}</span></td>\n        `;\n\n        tr.addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n          this.selectedHistoryVar = v.name;\n          this.renderVariableHistory(v.name, step);\n        });\n\n        this.varInspectorTbody.appendChild(tr);\n\n        // Render visual list cells if rawValue is an array\n        if (Array.isArray(v.rawValue)) {\n          const strip = document.createElement(\"div\");\n          strip.className = \"list-strip-card\";\n          const cellsHTML = v.rawValue\n            .map((itemVal, idx) => {\n              const isPointed = currentIdx === idx;\n              return `\n                <div class=\"list-cell ${isPointed ? \"active-idx\" : \"\"}\">\n                  <span class=\"list-cell-i\">${isPointed ? `i=${idx}▼` : `[${idx}]`}</span>\n                  <span class=\"list-cell-v\">${this.escapeHTML(String(itemVal))}</span>\n                </div>\n              `;\n            })\n            .join(\"\");\n\n          strip.innerHTML = `\n            <div class=\"flow-mini-label\">${this.escapeHTML(v.name)} (List Index View ${currentIdx !== null && v.rawValue[currentIdx] !== undefined ? `— ${v.name}[${currentIdx}] = ${v.rawValue[currentIdx]}` : \"\"})</div>\n            <div class=\"list-cells-row\">${cellsHTML}</div>\n          `;\n          this.visualListsContainer.appendChild(strip);\n        }\n      });\n    }\n\n    if (this.selectedHistoryVar) {\n      this.renderVariableHistory(this.selectedHistoryVar, step);\n    }\n  }\n\n  renderVariableHistory(varName, step) {\n    const html = this.explainer.explainVariableClick(varName, step, this.traceResult);\n    this.varHistoryBox.innerHTML = this.formatMarkdown(html);\n    this.varHistoryBox.classList.remove(\"hidden\");\n  }\n\n  renderBuiltInQuestionAnswer() {\n    if (!this.traceResult || !this.traceResult.steps.length) return;\n    const step = this.traceResult.steps[this.currentStepIdx];\n    const ans = this.explainer.answerBuiltInQuestion(\n      this.activeQuestionId,\n      step,\n      this.traceResult\n    );\n    this.questionAnswerBox.innerHTML = this.formatMarkdown(ans);\n  }\n\n  /* ==========================================\n     PANEL D: 7-Part Beginner Explanation\n     ========================================== */\n  renderPanelDExplanation(step) {\n    const exp = step.explanations;\n    const whatLine =\n      this.explanationMode === \"technical\" ? exp.whatTechnical : exp.whatBeginner;\n\n    this.exp1WhatLineDoes.innerHTML = this.formatMarkdown(whatLine);\n    this.exp2Symbols.innerHTML = this.formatMarkdown(exp.symbolsMeaning);\n    this.exp3WhyNow.innerHTML = this.formatMarkdown(exp.whyExecuting);\n    this.exp4VarsBefore.innerHTML = this.formatMarkdown(exp.variablesBefore);\n    this.exp5ChangesAfter.innerHTML = this.formatMarkdown(exp.whatChangesAfter);\n    this.exp6WhyCondition.innerHTML = this.formatMarkdown(exp.whyCondition);\n    this.exp7NextLine.innerHTML = this.formatMarkdown(exp.whatNext);\n  }\n\n  formatMarkdown(str) {\n    if (!str) return \"\";\n    return String(str)\n      .replace(/&/g, \"&amp;\")\n      .replace(/</g, \"&lt;\")\n      .replace(/>/g, \"&gt;\")\n      .replace(/&lt;br&gt;/g, \"<br>\")\n      .replace(/\\*\\*(.+?)\\*\\*/g, \"<strong>$1</strong>\")\n      .replace(/`([^`]+)`/g, \"<code>$1</code>\");\n  }\n\n  escapeHTML(str) {\n    return String(str)\n      .replace(/&/g, \"&amp;\")\n      .replace(/</g, \"&lt;\")\n      .replace(/>/g, \"&gt;\");\n  }\n}\n\nwindow.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", () => {\n  window.visualizerApp = new CodeFlowVisualizerApp();\n});\n","Description":"Update app.js to integrate engine.js, explainer.js, Input Playground, Built-In Questions, Practice Mode, and 7-Part Beginner Explanation","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\CVT\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\code-flow-visualizer\\app.js","toolAction":"Updating app.js controller","toolSummary":"Update app.js for full 15-section Code Flow Visualizer"}}]}
