{"step_index":68,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-10T10:41:34Z","input_tokens":5481,"cache_read_tokens":188026,"output_tokens":531,"thinking":"Addressing the visual display issues: top padding/clipping in the flowchart container and styling the clickable timeline steps require updating the stylesheet. The strategy involves appending the necessary CSS rules to the existing `styles.css` file.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"Append":true,"CodeContent":"\n/* Fix Flowchart SVG top padding and add clickable Execution Timeline Strip */\n.flowchart-svg-wrap {\n  display: block;\n  text-align: center;\n  padding: 16px 12px;\n  overflow-y: auto;\n}\n\n.timeline-strip {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 4px;\n  padding: 6px 10px;\n  background: var(--bg-panel);\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-muted);\n  overflow-x: auto;\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n}\n\n.timeline-step-pill {\n  padding: 2px 7px;\n  border-radius: 4px;\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n  font-size: 10.5px;\n  background: var(--bg-input);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n  white-space: nowrap;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n}\n\n.timeline-step-pill.visited {\n  border-color: rgba(63, 185, 80, 0.4);\n  color: #7ee787;\n}\n\n.timeline-step-pill.current {\n  background: #1f6feb;\n  border-color: #58a6ff;\n  color: #ffffff;\n  font-weight: 700;\n}\n","Description":"Add CSS for clickable Execution Timeline Strip and fix flowchart SVG scroll alignment","Overwrite":false,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\CVT\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\code-flow-visualizer\\styles.css","toolAction":"Updating styles.css for flowchart and timeline strip","toolSummary":"Fix flowchart clipping and style timeline strip in styles.css"}}]}
